3.368" end="0:43.678">来</span></p><p begin="0:43.894" end="0:46.524" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:43.894" end="0:44.254">東</span><span begin="0:44.254" end="0:44.594">京</span><span begin="0:44.594" end="0:44.714">に</span><span begin="0:44.714" end="0:45.064">持っ</span><span begin="0:45.064" end="0:45.364">た</span><span begin="0:45.364" end="0:45.624">大</span><span begin="0:45.624" end="0:45.794">き</span><span begin="0:45.794" end="0:45.994">な</span><span begin="0:45.994" end="0:46.154">期</span><span begin="0:46.154" end="0:46.524">待</span></p><p begin="0:46.717" end="0:49.357" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:46.717" end="0:46.857">だ</span><span begin="0:46.857" end="0:47.117">け</span><span begin="0:47.117" end="0:47.227">ど</span><span begin="0:47.227" end="0:47.637">現</span><span begin="0:47.637" end="0:47.987">実</span><span begin="0:47.987" end="0:48.187">は</span><span begin="0:48.187" end="0:48.527">甘</span><span begin="0:48.527" end="0:48.647">く</span><span begin="0:48.647" end="0:48.937">な</span><span begin="0:48.937" end="0:49.037">く</span><span begin="0:49.037" end="0:49.357">て</span></p><p begin="0:49.621" end="0:52.511" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:49.621" end="0:49.931">落ち</span><span begin="0:49.931" end="0:50.061">葉</span><span begin="0:50.061" end="0:50.281">見</span><span begin="0:50.281" end="0:50.461">つ</span><span begin="0:50.461" end="0:50.721">め</span> <span begin="0:50.721" end="0:51.001">深</span><span begin="0:51.001" end="0:51.211">く</span><span begin="0:51.211" end="0:51.631">思い</span><span begin="0:51.631" end="0:51.821">詰</span><span begin="0:51.821" end="0:52.081">め</span><span begin="0:52.081" end="0:52.231">て</span><span begin="0:52.231" end="0:52.511">た</span></p><p begin="0:52.757" end="0:55.657" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:52.757" end="0:53.157">そん</span><span begin="0:53.157" end="0:53.297">な</span><span begin="0:53.297" end="0:53.497">と</span><span begin="0:53.497" end="0